	"data": "Concept: AR/XR Development\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal is an active XR developer (MetaQuest, OpenXR, Unity) who thinks about augmented reality not as a curiosity but as the interface layer for his future systems. AR is where ThoughtBubbles lives in its final form — spatially, physically, persistently in the environment.\n\nHis professional XR work (Air Hockey, freelance) runs alongside a broader personal vision: AR as the ambient computing layer of daily life.\n\nKey Threads\n\nTrue AR Glasses (Sep…",
